<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Guaranty Trust Bank 9-month profits dip.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Guaranty Trust Bank 9-month profits dip.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month results for Guaranty Trust Bank Nigeria Plc to end-November.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>					1996	1995</p>
<p>Gross earnings		  1,710.1   1,405.7</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	  592.9     690.1</p>
<p>Taxation			    189.7     255.3</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	   403.2     434.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The bank said shrinking margins in the sector had had a negative impact on earnings. It added that it did not expect the trend to improve significantly in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
